    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71316" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῠός</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>daughter-in-law,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				22.65
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				3.451
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Ven.</u>
				136
			</span></i> ; <i>daughter-by-marriage</i> of the race of which the
			husband is a son, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				3.49
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>bride, wife,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				18.15
			</span></i> ; cj. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				12.53.5
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>) :—<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνυός</span> is
				f.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				3.32
			</span></i>. (I.-<i><span class="en">
				E.
			</span></i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σνῠσός,</span> cf.
				Skt.<i>snusā,</i> OHG. <i>snur,</i> Lat.
				<i>nurus,</i> etc.)</div>
